# ============================================================
# AI Project Documentation
# ============================================================
#
# IMPORTANT:
# AGENTS.md and .kiro/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# They should be committed because they contain:
#
# AGENTS.md
#   - Project Memory
#   - Agent instructions
#   - Project-wide rules
#
# .kiro/
#   - Steering
#   - Discovery
#   - Requirements
#   - Gap analysis
#   - Design
#   - Tasks
#
# This allows every implementation branch to use the same
# project specification and source of truth.
#
# ============================================================

# DO NOT add:
# AGENTS.md
# .kiro/

